		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Red elemental dancing spirit, beckoning mortals with charming allure.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 21, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 dagger (close/near) +4 (1d4) or dance, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Dance</strong>. Compel one mortal within near that can see veela to dance. CHA 15+ or dance for 1d4 rounds, taking 1 CON damage per round. While dancing, mortals CHA 15+ or cannot take hostile actions against veela.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Only damaged by magical sources. Immune to fire.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
